      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Kindly Note :\ni) Viewings strictly by appointment. To schedule a viewing contact : Email: castleforbes.house AT gmail.com\nii) To see current offers and/or to submit a formal offer: www.swiftly.ie website -> the property listing -> follow the steps.\n----\nSwiftly are delighted to bring Apartment 120 Castleforbes Square, IFSC, Dublin 1 to the market.\n\nThis beautiful fully furnished, turnkey home features a bright, open-plan layout and a large private terrace.\n\nThe accommodation opens into a welcoming entrance hall with stunning herringbone flooring, a convenient storage room, a house alarm, and an intercom system. To the right is a generously sized family bathroom with tiled flooring and partially tiled walls.\n\nThe spacious double bedroom features wooden flooring, sophisticated fitted wardrobes and a large window overlooking the terrace.\n\nThe light filled open plan living room and dining area also enjoys newly fitted wooden floors, floor to ceiling windows and access to an amazing south east facing paved terrace, making it the perfect place to relax & entertain. The accommodation is completed by an open kitchen with a standalone kitchen island, splashback tiling and plenty of counter & cupboard space.\n\nCastleforbes Square is ideally located in Dublin?s Docklands just a short stroll from the IFSC. There is a LUAS stop on your doorstep as well as bus G1/G2 bringing you straight to the city center of Dublin. The area accommodates shops, gyms, bars, cafes and restaurants. The 3 Arena is a short stroll away as is North Wall Quay which enjoys lovely pedestrian walkways and cycle lanes along the River Liffey.\n\nKey Features\n1. Turn key\n2. Fully furnished home \n3. Open lay-out\n4. Large open terrace \n5. Privacy windows\n"
      },
